# Experiment code and prose are versioned by default. JSON evidence is added
# explicitly after review so corpus payloads and CLI transcripts stay local.
*
!*/
!*.py
!*.md
!*.toml
.gitignore
# Runtime dependencies, downloaded source/data, and frozen source copies.
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/tool-dependencies/
**/*-source-archive/
**/upstream/
**/raw/
**/metadata/
